00:30:20,248 --> 00:30:24,048
生きて生き抜いていくのよ
You gotta live and survive through it all!

394
00:30:26,048 --> 00:30:27,248
Let's go!

395
00:30:38,248 --> 00:30:40,848
ダッダッダッ くだらない
Da-da-da, so pointless!

396
00:30:40,848 --> 00:30:44,048
言葉ばかりが譲れない
Nothing but unyielding words.

397
00:30:44,048 --> 00:30:46,848
わかるか？あたしの美学
Do you get my aesthetics?

398
00:30:46,848 --> 00:30:50,048
この場は承知の威勢
Showing off full well on this stage.

399
00:30:50,048 --> 00:30:52,248
気の小石ひとつが
A single small pebble of spirit

400
00:30:52,248 --> 00:30:54,248
切り札
turning into a trump card.

401
00:30:56,248 --> 00:30:58,848
ガラガラタワー
Clattering tower,

402
00:30:58,848 --> 00:31:02,548
一撃KO さらば！
one-hit KO, farewell!

403
00:31:08,048 --> 00:31:14,548
Every otomo and every gremlin home, put your hands up!

404
00:31:22,048 --> 00:31:23,848
こんなもんじゃない
It's not just this!

405
00:31:23,848 --> 00:31:26,048
ダッダッダッ あたしよ
Da-da-da, it's me!

406
00:31:26,048 --> 00:31:29,548
どんなになれる？清も濁も甘いも酸いも
What can I become? Purity, impurity, sweet and sour,

407
00:31:29,548 --> 00:31:31,048
見分けて今
telling them apart now!

408
00:31:31,048 --> 00:31:33,848
燦々交わるミライ
A brilliantly intersecting future,

409
00:31:33,848 --> 00:31:35,848
遅いこともないわ
it's never too late,

410
00:31:35,848 --> 00:31:38,248
わかるでしょ？
you understand, right?

411
00:31:38,248 --> 00:31:40,048
期待 期待 待ってくれない
Expectations won't wait.

412
00:31:40,048 --> 00:31:43,048
連れてってあげる 生き抜いて頂戴
I'll take you along, so please survive!

413
00:31:43,048 --> 00:31:49,048
Ah... 愛ある時代！
Ah... an era filled with love!

414
00:31:56,248 --> 00:31:59,548
それでは皆様、お先にバイキャ！
Well then everyone, bye-bye for now!

415
00:32:00,048 --> 00:32:02,548
わかりました！
Understood!

416
00:32:14,348 --> 00:32:15,548
Are you thinking...

417
00:32:15,548 --> 00:32:17,248
...what I'm thinking?

418
00:32:17,248 --> 00:32:18,548
I think I am!

419
00:32:18,548 --> 00:32:20,548
Oh my God! We have to bring this...

420
00:32:20,548 --> 00:32:22,048
Write this down! Write this down right now!

421
00:32:22,048 --> 00:32:23,048
We're going to the suit!

422
00:32:27,548 --> 00:32:29,848
Oh my God, they're gonna love this!

423
00:32:29,848 --> 00:32:30,848
They're gonna love it!

424
00:32:32,048 --> 00:32:34,548
They're gonna love us! They love us!

425
00:32:48,848 --> 00:32:50,848
This is bad.

426
00:32:52,548 --> 00:32:56,048
This is bad.

427
00:33:01,848 --> 00:33:03,848
I'm going to give up on my dreams.

428
00:33:04,048 --> 00:33:06,048
Never give up on your dreams.

429
00:33:07,548 --> 00:33:08,848
Really?

430
00:33:09,048 --> 00:33:13,048
Yeah. I feel like you had half a good idea...

431
00:33:14,548 --> 00:33:17,048
...and you had half a good idea, too.

432
00:33:17,048 --> 00:33:22,048
And together... that's a whole good idea.

433
00:33:22,048 --> 00:33:25,048
We'll get the funding one day.

434
00:33:28,048 --> 00:33:32,048
Thank you very much everyone that helped us work on all these shows together.

435
00:33:32,048 --> 00:33:35,548
Thank you to all our beautiful, wonderful guests!

436
00:33:35,548 --> 00:33:39,048
And thank you to you, grems and otomos...

437
00:33:39,048 --> 00:33:42,548
...at home, watching us today during our TV show.

438
00:33:44,048 --> 00:33:48,048
Please sign our petition and look at the credits!

439
00:33:48,048 --> 00:33:52,548
And don't forget there's something else coming up in just a few minutes!

440
00:33:52,548 --> 00:33:55,548
Very special, right after this! So don't change the channel!

441
00:33:55,548 --> 00:33:59,048
Don't change the channel just yet! Put down that remote!

442
00:33:59,048 --> 00:34:02,048
Gun to your head, put it down right now!

443
00:34:02,048 --> 00:34:08,548
Put down the remote right now! There's something really cool coming up right after this!

444
00:34:12,048 --> 00:34:18,548
The Autofister Network! 3D LIVE!

